  "message.googology.guide": "§bGuogaology§r\nBuild an End-portal-shaped ring from 12 whole cakes or Guogao blocks of any color; mixing is allowed (5×5 without corners, empty 3×3 center).\nThrow an apple: Overworld ↔ Guogaology.\nThrow a Guogao block: enter the Guogao Underworld; from there, return to Guogaology.\nHorizontal distances, Overworld : Guogaology : Guogao Underworld = 1 : 4 : 16.\nFalling into the Guogaology void leads to the Underworld at Y=500. Quarter gravity; no fall damage.\nReturn through a portal. Administrators can also use /googology return.",
